## Unit Tests — Learner Role RBAC (D1)

| # | Test Case | Expected | Category |
|---|-----------|----------|----------|
| L1 | Learner can call check-progress | `isToolAuthorized("check-progress", "learner") → true` | Auth/Security |
| L2 | Learner can call check-savings | `isToolAuthorized("check-savings", "learner") → true` | Auth/Security |
| L3 | Learner can call verify-achievement | `isToolAuthorized("verify-achievement", "learner") → true` | Auth/Security |
| L4 | Learner can call accept-invite | `isToolAuthorized("accept-invite", "learner") → true` | Auth/Security |
| L5 | Learner cannot call configure-policy | `isToolAuthorized("configure-policy", "learner") → false` | Auth/Security |
| L6 | Learner cannot call distribute-allowance | `isToolAuthorized("distribute-allowance", "learner") → false` | Auth/Security |
| L7 | Learner cannot call invite-member | `isToolAuthorized("invite-member", "learner") → false` | Auth/Security |
| L8 | Learner cannot call manage-members | `isToolAuthorized("manage-members", "learner") → false` | Auth/Security |

## Unit Tests — Child-Scoped Data Access (D2)

| # | Test Case | Expected | Category |
|---|-----------|----------|----------|
| CS1 | `getChildScope` returns childName for learner | Learner member with `childName: "Maya"` → `"Maya"` | Auth/Security |
| CS2 | `getChildScope` returns null for manager | Manager → `null` (all children visible) | Auth/Security |
| CS3 | `getChildScope` returns null for co-parent | Co-parent → `null` (all children visible) | Auth/Security |
| CS4 | Learner check-progress returns only their child | Two children configured, Maya learner calls → only Maya's report | Auth/Security |
| CS5 | Learner check-savings returns only their child | Maya learner → only Maya's savings entries | Auth/Security |
| CS6 | Manager check-progress returns all children | Manager → both Maya and Carlos reports | Functionality |

