| BF1 | verify-achievement audit entry uses caller memberId | Co-parent calls verify → audit `actor` = co-parent's memberId, not "manager" | Functionality |
| BF2 | distribute-allowance audit entry uses caller memberId | Manager calls distribute → audit `actor` = manager's memberId | Functionality |
