## Edge Cases

| # | Edge Case | Expected | Category |
|---|-----------|----------|----------|
| EC1 | Learner invited without childName | `invite-member` returns error: "childName required for learner role" | Design/UX |
| EC2 | Learner childName doesn't match any configured child | `accept-invite` returns error: "child not found in family config" | Design/UX |
| EC3 | Two learners for the same child | Both can view same child's data, both can self-report. Audit distinguishes by verifiedBy. | Functionality |
| EC4 | Learner calls verify-achievement for nonexistent child | Returns error: "child not found" (same as current behavior) | Functionality |
| EC5 | OWS_PASSPHRASE not set + distribute called | Returns error: "wallet passphrase not configured" (not a crash) | Auth/Security |
| EC6 | x402 payment for wrong amount | 402 error with correct payment instructions | Auth/Security |
| EC7 | stdio mode + x402 tool call | Tool executes without payment (stdio = free) | Functionality |
| EC8 | Learner calls manage-members | Access denied: "learner role cannot use manage-members" | Auth/Security |
| EC9 | Release savings in dry-run mode | Preview shows what would release without transferring | Functionality |
| EC10 | Category % sum exactly 100 with decimals (33.33 + 33.33 + 33.34) | Pass — no floating point issues | Functionality |

